From 0fd8b1d072f96c1b6879cbe173351777c9954d76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abdulaziz <alanziabdulaziz4@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 06:30:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 12/15] llama: document the recurrent rollback invariant on
 llama_memory_seq_rm

A micro-batch snapshots the state after each of its last min(T, K) - 1 tokens and
never the state it started from (ops.cpp slot = n_tokens - 1 - t, in-place and
gathered alike, upstream 1a07bfa included), so a partial removal of a sequence's
tail is a rollback of n positions only while 1 <= n <= min(T - 1, n_snap) with T the
token count of the sequence's last micro-batch: N single-token decodes followed by
N positions back never had a snapshot to read and are refused since 317e4d0
instead of reading a plane an older micro-batch wrote. State it on the API.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QrdPnP5KL449GsoWBZx52R
---
 include/llama.h | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/llama.h b/include/llama.h
index 781a425..20fd015 100644
--- a/include/llama.h
+++ b/include/llama.h
@@ -751,6 +751,14 @@ extern "C" {
     // seq_id < 0 : match any sequence [TAG_LLAMA_SEQ_ID_NEG]
     // p0 < 0     : [0,  p1]
     // p1 < 0     : [p0, inf)
+    // Recurrent memory with rollback snapshots (n_rs_seq > 0): removing the tail [p0, inf) of a
+    // sequence is honoured as a rollback of n = pos_max - p0 + 1 positions only when
+    // 1 <= n <= min(T - 1, n_snap), where T is the token count of the sequence's last micro-batch
+    // and n_snap its snapshot budget (llama_memory_seq_rs_snapshots, default n_rs_seq): a micro-batch
+    // snapshots the state after each of its last min(T, n_rs_seq + 1) - 1 tokens and never the state
+    // it started from, so a rollback across earlier micro-batches (e.g. N single-token decodes, then
+    // N positions back) is refused rather than read from a stale plane. The rollback stays pending
+    // until the sequence's next decode consumes it; a second partial removal before that is refused
     LLAMA_API bool llama_memory_seq_rm(
             llama_memory_t mem,
               llama_seq_id seq_id,
